  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to AI driven digital platform.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Utumoja is designing this platform to make access to funding easier while fostering a more resilient startup ecosystem and empowering startups to navigate complex funding processes efficiently. The platform will leverage cutting-edge AI technologies &#x2014;such as Natural Language Processing and predictive analytics&#x2014;to create a scalable, user-friendly resource for entrepreneurs across different growth stages, contributing to Kenya&apos;s economic resilience and global competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
